      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقضأهُ</span></b>  <i>He gave him to eat;</i> (S, O, K;)
namely, a man: (S, O:) some say that it is with
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ف</span>: (TA in this art.:) but Sh says that it is with
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ق</span>, after mentioning <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افضآه</span> as transmitted from
A 'Obeyd from As (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فضا</span>.)

